      102.79,
      419.18,
      162.86
    ],
    "text": "\u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82 \u0d9a\u0dcf \u0dc0 \u0dc3\u0db3\u0dc4\u0dcf \u0dc3 \u0db8\u0dcf \u0db1\u0dca\u200d\u0dba \u0dba \u0d9a\u0dcf \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9c\u0dd4\u0dab \u0d85\u0db1\u0dca\u200d\u0dba \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0d9a\u0dd2\u0dba GENERAL WEATHER FORECAST FOR SRI LANKA \u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0d9c\u0dd4\u0dab \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0daf\u0dba\u0dcf \u0db8\u0db0\u0dca\u200d\u0dba\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dae\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dc4\u0dda, \u0d85\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dd0\u0d9a\u0dd2 \u0d85\u0d82\u0dc1\u0dba \u0db8\u0d9c\u0dd2\u0db1\u0dca \u0db1\u0dd2\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dad\u0dca \u0d9a\u0dbb\u0db1 \u0dbd\u0daf\u0dd2 Issued by Forecasting Division, National Meteorological Centre",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold",
      "Iskoola Pota",
      "Iskoola Pota,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.960000038146973,
      12.0,
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      177.74,
      178.34,
      414.61,
      194.66
    ],
    "text": "WEATHER FORECAST FOR 15 November 2026",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599999785423279,
      12.479999542236328
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      187.13,
      199.7,
      405.37,
      212.18
    ],
    "text": "Issued at 2.00 p.m. on 14 November 2026",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.479999542236328
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.32,
      216.23,
      534.0,
      290.93
    ],
    "text": "The low-pressure area located in the Bay of Bengal, east of Sri Lanka, was located approximately 650 km east of Batticaloa. The system is expected to move northwestwards, away from the eastern coast of the island and likely to intensify into a 'depression' by tomorrow (November 15).",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.32,
      294.86,
      513.15,
      319.52
    ],
    "text": "Due to the influence of this system, cloudy skies will prevail over the entire island tomorrow.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.039999961853027,
      12.0,
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.32,
      322.94,
      534.04,
      363.89
    ],
    "text": "Showers will occur at times in the Northern, North-Central, Eastern, Western and North-Western provinces, and in the Galle and Matara districts.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.32,
      367.94,
      534.51,
      392.48
    ],
    "text": "Fairly heavy rainfall above 75 mm are likely at some places in the Northern and Eastern provinces.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.039999961853027,
      12.0,
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.32,
      396.02,
      533.72,
      436.97
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thundershowers may occur at a few places in the Uva and Central provinces and in the Hambantota district during the evening or night.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.32,
      450.92,
      533.87,
      484.63
    ],
    "text": "The general public is kindly requested to take adequate precautions to minimize damage caused by temporary localized strong winds and lightning during thundershowers.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      2.0399999618530273,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.32,
      488.68,
      533.9,
      748.66
    ],
    "text": "Misty conditions can be expected at some places in Western, Sabaragamuwa, Central and Uva provinces and in Galle, Matara and Kurunegala districts during the early hours of the morning.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      94.1,
      780.79,
      497.49,
      789.79
    ],
    "text": "Rainfall amount (mm): Light: 00-12.5, Light to moderate: 12.5-25, Moderate: 25-50, Fairly heavy rain: 50 -100,",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      197.93,
      793.39,
      393.2,
      802.39
    ],
    "text": "Heavy rain: 100 \u2013 150, Very heavy rain: 150 or more.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.960000038146973,
      9.0
